We are looking to engage a Commissioning Manager, who will become the main reference for the Client as to product performance aspects and as to technical aspects related to Pre-commissioning and Commissioning activities.
Also, act as the main corporate reference to planning, systems present in the product, execution sequences, andtechnical aspects related toPre-commissioning and Commissioning.
